      <p begin="00:16.640" end="00:19.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Damn, Callan (Damn, Callan)</p>
      <p begin="00:19.020" end="00:21.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">One bad bitch and she do what I say so (One, gang)</p>
