      <p begin="00:24.320" end="00:26.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Three more millions when you ask how my day go (Three)</p>
      <p begin="00:26.320" end="00:29.040" ttm:agent="v1">Poured up a four, now that blueberry Faygo</p>
      <p begin="00:29.040" end="00:31.460" ttm:agent="v1">One false move, and we straight to shooting shit</p>
      <p begin="00:31.460" end="00:33.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Two small bands just to take you out real quick (Bands)</p>
      <p begin="00:33.870" end="00:36.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Three more hoes, pull up, I'm fucking shit (Three more, gang)</p>
