      <p begin="00:55.760" end="00:58.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">That's how it goes, big bands, I'm thumbin' shit (Gang)</p>
      <p begin="00:58.230" end="01:00.460" ttm:agent="v1">I'm with my niggas, yeah, we some rockstars</p>
      <p begin="01:00.460" end="01:02.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And I'm with my nigga, yeah, KK Wokhardt (KK Wokhardt)</p>
